      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned child process immediately before that process starts**. \n\nSpecifically, the page states that:\n\n1. A local secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup\n2. The key is injected only into the **environment of the spawned Ingest agent child process** (and similarly for the Query agent process)\n3. The Hub\u0027s own process environment is never mutated\n\nThis scoping ensures that a compromised or misbehaving Hub process cannot leak the credential simply by inspecting its own environment variables \u2014 the key exists only inside the short-lived child process that actually calls the Anthropic API.",
